{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18788","headline":"崔元受少府自贬所还遗山姜花以诗答之 · 刘禹锡","name":"崔元受少府自贬所还遗山姜花以诗答之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故人博罗尉，遗我山姜花。\n采从碧海上，来自谪仙家。\n云涛润孤根，阴火照晨葩。\n静摇扶桑日，艳对瀛洲霞。\n世人爱芳辛，搴撷忘幽遐。\n传名入帝里，飞驿辞天涯。\n王济本尚味，石崇方鬬奢。\n雕盘多不识，绮席乃增华。\n驿马损筋骨，贵人滋齿牙。\n顾予藜藿士，持此重咨嗟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18788.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18788","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}